            "review_text": "Itravel0ne\nKota Kinabalu, Malaysia2604 contributions\n0\nLocal Vietnamese food\nSep 2022 • Family\nOur tour guide brought us to this local place where the patrons are mostly locals so we can experience real local Vietnam food. My Quang tho (Quang noodle in clay pot) is their signature dish. We also ordered rice paper roll with Dai Loc pork and the beef noodle. While we are not expert in Vietnamese cuisine, we thoroughly enjoyed the dinner.\nWritten September 15, 2022",
