            "review_text": "True Vietnam - Gorgeous Local Experience\nHanoi, Vietnam129 contributions\n0\nExpensive, not much to say.\nAug 2019\nMy family had a vacation in Da nang on August 19th to 23th. On the second night, I googled some places for dinner, then I found this restaurant. It seems that pretty popular in Danang. I ordered \"Bun mam\" (Noodle, pork, and fish sauce mixed) (\"My quang\" (Quang style noodle soup) and \"Banh trang thit heo\" (rice pancake rolls with pork). The receipt I got after having dinner is about VND300,000/4 persons. With its mediocre quality,it's pretty high to me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 28, 2019",
