            "review_text": "Jim\nSydney, Australia261 contributions\n0\nGood local place on My Khe beach\nJul 2019 • Couples\nWe are staying at the Stella Maris hotel near the beach and were looking for an easy local restaurant. One if the staff pointed us in the direction of ba mua as it was her favourite noodle place. \n\nNo English happening there but we managed to let them know my wife is a vegetarian and we had three. Ice dishes. Very low cost , quick service , good food. What else would you want? 😎\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 1, 2019",
