            "review_title": "Review at My Quang Ba Mua",
            "review_text": "quang le\n6 contributions\n0\nUnassuming restaurant, definitive mi Quang experience\nJan 2019 • Couples\nWe visited the restaurant at noon as refered by hotel staff and ride-share drivers as the best mi Quang place.\nThe restaurant is unassuming on the outside and not crowded. We ordered the standard mi Quang and the dish came out looking better than the menu stock photo. Portion size is just right for one person.\n\nDefinitely the best mi Quang I have ever had with right balance of all ingredients. One note is that the dish includes some frog meat (for folks who are not into it)\n\nOverall excellent mi Quang, very casual experience. \n\nOne negative point: The restaurant ran out of stock for some drinks we tried to order that day, but the drinks we got was of good quality.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 6, 2019",
